Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.39,0:00:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.93,0:00:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.53,0:00:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.71,0:01:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter what\Ncard you play next, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.49,0:01:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You have nothing that can\Nwithstand the phenomenal
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.49,0:01:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,attack strength of my\NBlue Eyes Ultimate Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.37,0:01:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You might as well give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.69,0:01:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That Ultimate Dragon can wipe out the rest\Nof Yugi's life points with one breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.03,0:01:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba has the upper hand and he knows it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.35,0:01:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just waiting for Yugi to back down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.31,0:01:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see how Yugi\Ncan pull this one out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.37,0:01:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.61,0:01:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I just drew the card that will defend me\Nagainst your Blue-Eyes Ultimate Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.85,0:01:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.01,0:01:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch and learn!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.27,0:01:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.31,0:01:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The beginning of your defeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.57,0:01:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Karibo in attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.33,0:01:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.59,0:02:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,In the entire game, Karibo is\Nthe weakest monster! He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.89,0:02:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What can Yugi be thinking\Nplaying that little guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.95,0:02:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you're free to concede\Nand forfeit the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.85,0:02:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But come on, don't embarrass yourself\Nby playing that runt of a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.03,0:02:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You must know that's\Nthe puniest monster with
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.89,0:02:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,the lowest attack points\Nin all of Duel Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.81,0:02:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never known a serious duelist\Nto even keep one in their deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.63,0:02:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.54,0:02:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,don't insult my intelligence\Npretending that miserable creature
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.49,0:02:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,can defend against the unbridled\Nmight of my ultimate blue eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.39,0:02:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, you're mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.39,0:02:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This card will defend everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.87,0:02:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And before this duel's\Nover, your dragon will fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.61,0:02:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,My ultimate dragon? Nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.05,0:02:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and finish\Nyour turn so I can knock
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.03,0:02:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,the stuffing out of your\NKaribo and win the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.55,0:02:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.67,0:02:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My last card will be\Nthe magic card Multiply.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.77,0:02:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Multiply works with monsters with attack
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.97,0:03:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,power below 500 and\Nmultiplies them endlessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.95,0:03:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,More than you bargained for, eh, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.89,0:03:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So is this some kind of a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.23,0:03:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The joke's on you, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.31,0:03:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,When you attacked, you thought\NI only had one defender,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.37,0:03:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,but now I have many, and I'm getting\Nmore and more defenders by the second.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.61,0:03:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.55,0:03:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten the incredible\Nassault power my dragon possesses?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.17,0:03:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll burn him to a crisp.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.43,0:03:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Neutron blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.69,0:03:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.77,0:03:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait, what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.95,0:03:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,My dragon's attack had no\Neffect on your life points at
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.71,0:03:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,all and those annoying\Ncreatures continue to multiply.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.85,0:03:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.97,0:03:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't take my\Nremaining life points away,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.37,0:03:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, until you wipe out all the Karibo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.85,0:03:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But as quickly as you destroy\Nthem, they multiply right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.85,0:03:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hairballs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.76,0:04:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,For each one I destroy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.71,0:04:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Two more take its place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.67,0:04:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.87,0:04:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, you may have created\Nthe ultimate attack monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.51,0:04:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,but I've created the ultimate defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.91,0:04:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,An ever-expanding army\Nof furry protectors.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.43,0:04:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,They may not look like much, but they've\Nstopped your dragon in its tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.71,0:04:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.05,0:04:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, I go on the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.83,0:04:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You've nothing strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.61,0:04:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch me, for I'm going to show you the\Ncombo that will bring your dragon down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.19,0:04:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Mammoth Graveyard, Polymerization,\Nand the Living Arrow card.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.03,0:04:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What's a Living Arrow card?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.13,0:04:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Living Arrow allows me to use my other\Ncards in combination not with my own cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.71,0:04:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,but with my opponent's\Nmonsters. I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.07,0:04:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Normally, I make a fusion with\Nmy cards, But for a new twist,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.73,0:04:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Living Arrow lets me fuse\Nmy cards with your cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.99,0:04:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,opening up bold new possibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.05,0:04:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.23,0:05:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I can use the magical power\Nof the Living Arrow to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.83,0:05:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,bond my Mammoth Graveyard\Nto the heart of your beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.51,0:05:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No, my dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.03,0:05:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.67,0:05:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Since my Mammoth Graveyard\Nis an undead-type monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.77,0:05:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,he can't properly fuse with your\Nliving ultimate dragon instead
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.27,0:05:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,it causes your monster to rot and\Ndecay from the inside out each
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.09,0:05:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,turn your ultimate dragon will\Nlose attack points until your
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.37,0:05:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,creature is no
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.31,0:05:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,more your so-called
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.27,0:05:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,ultimate dragon and your victory is
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.99,0:05:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Rotting away, Kaiba? It's only a\Nmatter of time now, and there's
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.85,0:05:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,nothing you can do to stop it there\Nmust be something i can do to save
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.13,0:05:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,my ultimate dragon my mammoth\Ngraveyard has attack points of 1200
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.85,0:05:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,that means that each turn that goes\Nby he drains 1200 points from your
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.53,0:06:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ultimate Dragon's attack power.\NSoon it will be weak enough for
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.43,0:06:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Me to destroy? He's right, my dragon's\Ngetting weaker every turn, and
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.11,0:06:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing in my deck that can\Nreverse it. All right, that single
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.95,0:06:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,attack is bringing yuki back from\Nthe brink way to go yuki hey you're
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.09,0:06:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,the man great move you've had it\Nkaiba you're never gonna win this
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.97,0:06:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,match that's just like yuki even\Nwhen things are looking bad he
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.19,0:06:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,always manages to find a way to\Novercome his opponent never thought
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.27,0:06:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,i'd live to see the day that kaiba\Nwas outfoxed that yuki punk is good
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.29,0:06:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,There's just something about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.09,0:06:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He's intense, that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.69,0:06:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like you wouldn't let\Nnothing stop him from winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.31,0:06:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what do you say now, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.81,0:06:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess tree heads aren't better than one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.49,0:06:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.83,0:06:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.05,0:06:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The fate of Mokuba's\Nsoul rides on this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.77,0:06:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack now, Ultimate Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.49,0:06:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Neutron Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.81,0:06:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.35,0:07:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,When will you learn?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.61,0:07:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The Karibo multiply faster than you can\Neliminate them with your Neutron Blasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.59,0:07:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I will not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.47,0:07:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Cannot be defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.35,0:07:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll draw one more card and\Nlet my Mammoth finish my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.71,0:07:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon my Ultimate Dragon will be weak\Nenough for Yugi to destroy outright.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.77,0:07:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to keep trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.07,0:07:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.39,0:07:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Ultimate Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.17,0:07:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Neutron Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.29,0:07:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Once again, your attack has failed, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.83,0:07:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My defense holds, and you have no\Nother strategy to use against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.77,0:07:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Your time is running out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.37,0:07:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You should never have\Nchallenged me, Kaiba. You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.23,0:07:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My mammoth takes another\N1,200 points from your dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.47,0:07:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Even my weakest monsters\Ncan destroy it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.77,0:07:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it. I failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.51,0:08:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I failed my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.75,0:08:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I've failed Mokuba. His soul\Nwill be trapped forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.81,0:08:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Zato! Help, Zato! Please help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.95,0:08:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother please You promised\NYou promised to help me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.55,0:08:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.77,0:08:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Zato hurry I'm coming I'll help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.91,0:08:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let me down! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.27,0:08:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Big brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.99,0:08:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.47,0:08:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're rotten to the core,\NKaiba, just like that dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.93,0:08:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.91,0:08:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, Seto?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.99,0:08:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you help him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.39,0:08:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You promised you'd\Nalways be there for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.61,0:08:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You promised him, Seto Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.65,0:08:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You promised!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.61,0:09:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, ah, Boku-man!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.75,0:09:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba hasn't said a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.73,0:09:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like he's in another world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.09,0:09:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.47,0:09:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just standing there\Ncompletely spacing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.77,0:09:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's finally sunk\Nin. He's lost. True.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.93,0:09:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,In just a minute, it will all be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.95,0:09:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's almost sad to see a player\Nof his caliber take losing so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.13,0:09:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like there's gonna be a new champ.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.35,0:09:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter what card I draw now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.67,0:09:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Any monster can defeat\Nhis weakened dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.91,0:09:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Celtic Guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.45,0:10:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.29,0:10:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to meet your demise!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.21,0:10:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Celtic Guardian, attack Ultimate Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.19,0:10:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.10,0:10:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.27,0:10:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.83,0:10:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Once Yugi defeats Kaiba, he'll be\Nable to rescue his grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.29,0:10:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, the ultimate dragon's still standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.57,0:10:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.67,0:10:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because the ultimate dragon\Nis a fusion of three blue eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.37,0:10:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Each of its three heads\Nhas its own attack power.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.55,0:10:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Celtic Guardian took out one of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.27,0:10:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and Kaiba lost the 500 points\Ndifference in their attack strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.89,0:10:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But when the Celtic Guardian takes\Nout another weakened head next turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.85,0:10:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,that will wipe Kaiba\Nout and win the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.21,0:10:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean Kaiba's Toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.43,0:11:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, it can't end this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.99,0:11:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't defeat you in this duel,\NPegasus will keep Mokuba prisoner forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.59,0:11:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.37,0:11:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And even though I don't have a card\Nthat can keep you from attacking,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.65,0:11:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I still have a strategy\Nthat will stop you in your tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.51,0:11:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.65,0:11:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to force your hand\Nand win this battle, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.15,0:11:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks more like he's retreating to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.79,0:11:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a trick?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.13,0:11:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what's he up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.17,0:11:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.11,0:11:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.33,0:11:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What's Kaiba up to now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.23,0:11:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he think this cheap\Nstunt's gonna keep Yugi
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.23,0:11:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,from winning the match\Nand saving his grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.59,0:11:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Your move, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.67,0:11:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You can attack my blue eyes again and wipe
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.07,0:11:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,out my remaining life\Npoints But if you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.51,0:11:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,the resulting shock waves\Nmight cause me to lose my
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.99,0:12:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Balance. Don't tempt me. My fate\Nis completely in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.37,0:12:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi You'll decide this duel one way or\Nanother Of course, if you don't surrender,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.67,0:12:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I might be hurt You wouldn't\Nwant that, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.23,0:12:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.37,0:12:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You know this is dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.91,0:12:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh, Kaiba's bluffing. Now come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.31,0:12:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,drop this cheap ploy And\Nget down from that ledge and
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.95,0:12:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,play fair You know that Yugi\Ndoesn't want to hurt you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.43,0:12:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows. He's counting on Yugi\Nto surrender. But he can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.55,0:12:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,do that If he loses to Kaiba\NHe won't get into the castle
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.23,0:12:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like Kaiba will do\Nanything to come out ahead Just
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.11,0:12:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Like me. I'm warning you, Kaiba.\NDon't push me too far. I must win.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.89,0:12:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,to rescue my grandfather And\NI must win this duel to rescue
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.39,0:12:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba The difference is I'm\Nwilling to risk anything to do it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.85,0:12:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You know I can stand\Nup here all day, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.51,0:12:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm certain you won't make any attack\Nfor fear that you might knock me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.95,0:12:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though you know by not attacking,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.35,0:13:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,you give up the only chance\Nyou have to save your grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.29,0:13:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means I have the advantage over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.11,0:13:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,For in my case, there's\Nnothing holding me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.05,0:13:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, a magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.81,0:13:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Reborn the monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.21,0:13:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,which I'll use to resurrect\Nthe blue eyes head
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.65,0:13:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,that was just destroyed\Nby your guardian What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.81,0:13:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Restore a head of the blue eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.95,0:13:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now one of my blue eyes with its\Nnormal attack points of 3,000
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.51,0:13:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,has just been reborn With all\Nof your Karibos in defense mode,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.27,0:13:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't touch you But now that you've\Nput an attack monster on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.57,0:13:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I can take out the rest of\Nyour life points Which I'll do
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.31,0:13:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,next turn Two of Ultimate\NDragon's heads are still weakened,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.85,0:13:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,but the third can wipe out\Nyour guardian in a breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.11,0:13:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Our life points are equal, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.09,0:13:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike now if you dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.69,0:13:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, next turn, I\Nswear I'll take you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.25,0:13:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If I defeat one of the\Nweaker Blue Eyes, I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.69,0:13:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But what if the duel battle\Naccidentally knocks him off the ledge?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.89,0:13:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrender, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.11,0:14:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That is, unless you have the\Ncourage to unleash your attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.15,0:14:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I must.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.43,0:14:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.95,0:14:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We must.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.21,0:14:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.15,0:14:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.93,0:14:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.81,0:14:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.05,0:14:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.39,0:14:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.91,0:14:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like Yugi's struggling within\Nhimself to do the right thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.77,0:14:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,but he can't risk hurting Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.85,0:14:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, I've never backed away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.77,0:14:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm not starting now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.53,0:14:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Celtic Guardian, attack! Yugi! You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.45,0:14:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't take this risk!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.47,0:14:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Call him back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.03,0:14:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you can't do this! You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.77,0:14:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.39,0:14:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to stop, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.83,0:14:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.99,0:14:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.13,0:14:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.67,0:15:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Couldn't do it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.69,0:15:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,White lightning attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.87,0:15:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.85,0:15:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That underhanded\Nsleazeball wiped Yugi out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.49,0:15:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.41,0:15:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Pegasus, just now the battle\Nbetween Yugi and Kaiba was decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.59,0:15:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto Kaiba was the victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.93,0:15:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Kimo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.75,0:15:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall I allow Seto Kaiba to\Nenter the castle then, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.93,0:15:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, a deal is a deal. Done. Right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.07,0:16:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job, Kaiba boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.21,0:16:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wished, I will\Nbe your next opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.49,0:16:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But little Yugi didn't fare nearly so well\Nin this rematch between the two of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.05,0:16:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,His spirit is broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.57,0:16:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And his grandfather's soul remains. Mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.13,0:16:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.07,0:16:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That punk Yugi could have won the\Ngame, but he threw it away to Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.07,0:16:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Who ever heard of a duelist doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.39,0:16:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.45,0:16:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.41,0:16:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost couldn't control it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.71,0:16:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This other presence deep inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.61,0:16:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He was willing to go all\Nthe way against Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.59,0:16:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Another presence inside you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.75,0:16:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.85,0:16:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck are you\Ntalking about, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.95,0:16:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Like me, Yugi has some sort\Nof ancient spirit inside him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.55,0:17:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It has something to do\Nwith our Millennium Items.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.93,0:17:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid of this spirit inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.79,0:17:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So afraid that I will never duel again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.67,0:17:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.45,0:17:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about your grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.19,0:17:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But you did the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.97,0:17:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't hurt another\Nperson, not even to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.59,0:17:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't want to be saved that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.79,0:17:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I guess he got what he wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.79,0:17:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If Yugi had done what needed to be done,\Nhe would be entering the castle, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.09,0:17:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But he was too weak to\Nfollow through on his play.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.03,0:17:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He spared you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.79,0:17:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, he's showed you compassion,\Nwhich is more than you deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.43,0:17:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He lost the game. The game?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.27,0:17:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi may have lost one\Nlousy duel monster's game,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.13,0:17:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,but at least he hasn't lost his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.07,0:17:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Not like you, Seto Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.27,0:17:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You've spent so much\Ntime with your machines,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.35,0:17:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,you've forgotten what\Nbeing human is about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.83,0:17:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi has a heart, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.71,0:17:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi has us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.07,0:17:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Friends that'll stand with him to the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.25,0:18:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter whether he wins\Nor loses some lousy game.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.17,0:18:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And what do you have, Seto Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.09,0:18:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you have at the end\Nof the day? Tell me! Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.71,0:18:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I have all that I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.01,0:18:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, keep fooling yourself, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.41,0:18:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's twice the man you'll ever be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.45,0:18:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that was a fun way\Nto spend the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.29,0:18:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Your ten starships qualify you\Nto enter the Inner Sanctum.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.31,0:18:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,At last, I'm in,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.39,0:18:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm ready to face you,\NPegasus, once and for all.
